                <pb facs="0521" n="437" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg437"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Tower to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-02-19"><hi rendition="#italic">February 19,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Tower reports that the German Government has officially notified him of the
                    raising of the blockade of Puerto Cabello and Maracaibo.)</p>
            </div>
